  "explanation": "The question asks when Henry St John-Mildmay became the Baronet. The provided sources distinguish three individuals named Henry St John-Mildmay who each succeeded to the baronetcy at different times:\n\n1. **1784** - Document D1S3 states that 'He succeeded to the baronetcy and Dogmersfield Park in 1784.' This refers to the 3rd Baronet.\n2. **11 Nov. 1808** - Document D2S4 and D2S5 state that 'He succeeded his father in the baronetcy on 11 Nov. 1808.' This refers to the 4th Baronet.\n3. **1848** - Document D3S3 states that 'He succeeded his father as baronet in 1848.' This refers to the 5th Baronet.\n\nEach of these dates corresponds to a distinct individual with the same name, so all three are valid answers depending on which Henry St John-Mildmay is being referenced."
